      "raw_excerpt": "County of Maui\nCounty of Maui Mayor - 4 year term\n4 year term beginning noon on second day of January following election\nMaximum of 2 consecutive full terms\nJurisdictionIncumbentNext\nElection\nCounty of MauiRichard Bissen2026\nCounty of Maui Councilmembers - 2 year term\n2 year term beginning noon on second day of January following election\nMaximum of 5 consecutive full terms\nJurisdictionIncumbentNext\nElection\nEast MauiShane Sinenci2026\nWest MauiTamara Paltin2026\nWailuku-Waihee-WaikapuAlice Lee2026\nKahuluiKauanoe Batangan*2026\nSouth MauiTom Cook2026\nMakawao-Haiku-PaiaNohe Uu-Hodgins2026\nUpcountryYuki Lei Sugimura2026\nLanaiGabe Johnson2026\nMolokaiKeani Rawlins-Fernandez2026\n*On December 16, 2025, Councilmember Kauanoe Batangan was appointed by Mayor Richard Bissen to fill the vacancy created upon the passing of Tasha Kama.\n",
      "raw_excerpt_sha256": "1477dcbe89900bd9bb25356698f65d02ba292fc0c8fdbe464d7ee08f91671263",
      "excerpt_format": "NORMALIZED_VISIBLE_TEXT_WITH_MARKED_OMISSIONS"
    },
